      "passageSha256": "52dd60c93b795774c49b46ff70ff28b308b428c47a0a2cc43dc99ad8c5536128",
      "pdfPages": [
        70
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p070-03675-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Michael Jordan played baseball and football as well as basketball in high school.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8bf25099df97fa5897e35bf4e48a3512bcfcca0d21b4e9ad84fc6465d8bc7882",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p070-03675-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "457d948eb4c8376cd73a0eec0fb34ea9498f670dd9ee454a1dc82e01412a9547",
      "passageSha256": "52dd60c93b795774c49b46ff70ff28b308b428c47a0a2cc43dc99ad8c5536128",
      "pdfPages": [
        70
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p070-03675-s004",
      "sentenceText": "While he was mourning his father, he took a sabbatical from basketball for two years in his prime and played baseball.",
      "sentenceSha256": "91bfb591919a1f1c47f439e19192480b7ca451633a4d6fa57503fd64c47966a7",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p070-03675-r004-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "9397966ffec0598b462456e79048e2c38ec78eefdfba961710bcaba4344d914f",
      "passageSha256": "74cc2ab23a59bd0ced649e57f66ea2394f08fbd5114460d62284be3773035873",
      "pdfPages": [
        70
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p070-03675-s006",
      "sentenceText": "She played volleyball and ran track as well as played soccer in high school.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a46b4e2af0862c25d0bd7a9b3743f69b89ab2d9269516f96ffb74e031d895b46",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p070-03675-r004-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "9397966ffec0598b462456e79048e2c38ec78eefdfba961710bcaba4344d914f",
      "passageSha256": "74cc2ab23a59bd0ced649e57f66ea2394f08fbd5114460d62284be3773035873",
      "pdfPages": [
        70
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p070-05625-s002",
      "sentenceText": "That is, in adult elite competition, the athletes who started the sport later in their lives were more successful than those who started early.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8939820fb121245e3d5c623d78b952b3f017090f37d872dfe7eb66ce865679f3",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p070-05625-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "a0aa47da89c551850b3d28a9f44ee60587fdaa50b49d73559d431c3da19237c9",
      "passageSha256": "bca3abaacb7dd63a12ff2c8c3e162d778b061f1013b141089858c5298450d2cd",
      "pdfPages": [
        70
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p071-00750-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In the short term, specialization translates to success.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4a4749d44cd2987664b037eaa2214eeda1ff1ab2339a5edffe3b64da02afb40a",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p071-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "08c0a45696fb55f00fb4785abf21f6cd4031228dd4b9f6c614be6d9fa2b00947",
      "passageSha256": "7d225ce3b573d3a33cc66a166ac60db8f798f258ea0328c1667b1599918123cb",
      "pdfPages": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p071-00750-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In the long term, however, it doesn’t always pay off.",
      "sentenceSha256": "743f94320d4312f90ef44ee1c3ccf3050922817d87aaf65fb9a838e42cf7b336",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p071-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "08c0a45696fb55f00fb4785abf21f6cd4031228dd4b9f6c614be6d9fa2b00947",
      "passageSha256": "7d225ce3b573d3a33cc66a166ac60db8f798f258ea0328c1667b1599918123cb",
      "pdfPages": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p071-00750-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Indeed, this study found that a higher amount of youth-led play (e.g., pickup games) outside of an athlete’s primary sport was associated with higher performance among adult players.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e76e1e342a486e00d07bea8811206fd6329288a9a1b1e26a34fe29350428aee3",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p071-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "08c0a45696fb55f00fb4785abf21f6cd4031228dd4b9f6c614be6d9fa2b00947",
      "passageSha256": "7d225ce3b573d3a33cc66a166ac60db8f798f258ea0328c1667b1599918123cb",
      "pdfPages": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Intriguingly, the early specialization effect was replicated in a completely different professional domain: science.",
      "sentenceSha256": "005f194bea4ea48cc6086b8023312d05cf6e073eba259ded035563d0db0a9aa5",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "fd08e40fb31f071edd9ea588a15a2ff8e0e946a14161f44c328702e8f72c55f2",
      "passageSha256": "ac2631fb15ec56c197d780ea022c13012a774d6605c70fad1feae34bb1d2e42b",
      "pdfPages": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Another study compared forty-eight German Nobel laureates in physics, chemistry, economics, and medicine/physiology with the winners of the Leibniz Prize, which is Germany’s highest national science award.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e2d051ded1273be6d8ac84d5f57799aec8c8708de6ecf3309eb9a798fb30c529",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "fd08e40fb31f071edd9ea588a15a2ff8e0e946a14161f44c328702e8f72c55f2",
      "passageSha256": "ac2631fb15ec56c197d780ea022c13012a774d6605c70fad1feae34bb1d2e42b",
      "pdfPages": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-s004",
      "sentenceText": "The Leibniz Prize winners who did not win the Nobel Prize had earlier success than those who went on to be Nobel winners.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9f89bc9f14637b75304053ed2f3387adfe5aeae70e49be1551769b40472808d9",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "fd08e40fb31f071edd9ea588a15a2ff8e0e946a14161f44c328702e8f72c55f2",
      "passageSha256": "ac2631fb15ec56c197d780ea022c13012a774d6605c70fad1feae34bb1d2e42b",
      "pdfPages": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-s005",
      "sentenceText": "For instance, Leibniz winners were more likely to have won a scholarship as students than Nobel laureates.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b4cd0751d234ea42b24d0414ea82b8208ab3bba26d3b99b1ea2c69bfbf451c48",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "eecdafce44cf4489e8cbc67ac577bdf50cef73c373edbbe4db2698d4b106649d",
      "passageSha256": "6474e3a30bcda6d3d7627b8081426a4fd05abae0da999baf6f83b9af5b660645",
      "pdfPages": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0045",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-s007",
      "sentenceText": "So, Nobel laureates explored more diverse areas of study and made slower progress than Leibniz winners, but eventually reached the top without burning out.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4567160c580b2dd43d11640015d7495914bd2c8f0ff79e92a3b3d53a22737a20",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p071-02505-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "eecdafce44cf4489e8cbc67ac577bdf50cef73c373edbbe4db2698d4b106649d",
      "passageSha256": "6474e3a30bcda6d3d7627b8081426a4fd05abae0da999baf6f83b9af5b660645",
      "pdfPages": [
        71
